UID:d2f2a87e039e1ed287b52022c13965@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:On November 17\, the Center for Civic Friendship\, in partners
 hip with the Boston Red Sox\, invites the Assumption community to the laun
 ch of Assumption University’s Civic Friendship Playbook. There will be a
  special meet-and-greet in Pierre’s Pub at 5 p.m.\, featuring Red Sox st
 aff and a rare opportunity to see the historic 2004 World Series trophy up
  close. We will then gather in Curtis Performance Hall for a welcome from 
 President Greg Weiner and a panel discussion\, which will be moderated by 
 Professor Gary Senecal\, chair of the Sports Working Group. Panelists incl
 ude: Ella Bianchi\, Civic Friendship student David Friedman\, Executive Vi
 ce President\, Legal and Government Affairs\, Boston Red Sox Rich Gedman\,
  Boston Red Sox Hall of Famer Rory O’Donnell\, Football Captain Krystle 
 Robleski\, Director of Sports Performance Professor Sam Stoner\, Philosoph
 y Professor Greg Walsh\, Sports Marketing Source: Assumption University Ev
 ent page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events/events/civic-friendsh
 ip-playbook-sports-character-and-dialogue\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 mil
