BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Worcester Talking Book Library
DTSTART:20261117T173000
DTEND:20261117T183000
DTSTAMP:20261115T180210Z
UID:9493fa09d9da063df4b63d4a768df3@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The Worcester Talking Book Library provides free services to M
 assachusetts residents of any age who are unable to read traditional print
  materials due to a visual or physical disability. A representative from t
 he Talking Book Library will provide information about their resources and
  collections. This session is open to all and particularly those who are o
 r who care for someone who is unable to read traditional print materials. 
 For more information about the Talking Book Library\, visit https://talkin
 gbook.mywpl.org/ For accessibility needs\, please email Joanna Flanagan at
  jflanaga@holycross.edu. For more information about the Talking Book Libra
 ry\, visit https://talkingbook.mywpl.org/ For accessibility needs\, please
