DESCRIPTION:Can you create an Ignite event and MyHC for this event? Please
  join the Worcester Chamber of Commerce's Diverse Professional Roundtable'
 s Educational Meeting to hear our very own Holy Cross Faculty fellow and a
 ward-winning author\, NanaKwame Adjei-Brenyah for a thought-provoking talk
  exploring the intersections of race\, power\, violence\, and social justi
 ce. Through his incisive storytelling\, Adjei-Brenyah challenges audiences
  to confront uncomfortable truths about society and imagine new possibilit
 ies for change. Link to register: https://business.worcesterchamber.org/ev
 ents/details/diverse-professional-roundtable-educational-meeting-21338 Ple
 ase reach out to JEBI if the registration cost presents a barrier to parti
 cipation. College students attend for free Dress Code: Casual (jeans ok) -
